  "title": "The Best Slow Cooker Cream Corn",
  "description": "This is the best, easiest slow cooker cream corn. It&#39;s very rich, not diet food, but is always such a big hit I have to tell everyone how to make it! You may want to half this recipe for a smaller family, but this is excellent leftover a day or even two.",
