  "ingredients": [
    "4 (16 ounce) packages frozen corn kernels",
    "3 (8 ounce) packages cream cheese, cubed",
    "1 cup butter, cut into pieces",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "6 slices American cheese",
    "0.5 cup whole milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "In a 6 quart slow cooker, combine the corn, cream cheese, butter, sugar, American cheese and milk. Cover and set to Low. Cook for about 3 hours, stirring every 30 minutes. Cheese and milk burn easily, so I would not recommend cutting the time and using the High setting.",
